        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your father needs a beer, and it's your job to get it.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re just a kid, but you have work to do.  Search across your house, neighborhood, and mind to find what your father needs, and bring it back to him. Be quick though, it isn't safe for children to be alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/ae13f482febf3d4fd0139d87b583b1d5.poster.avif?t=1760553896\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/ae13f482febf3d4fd0139d87b583b1d5.webm?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/ae13f482febf3d4fd0139d87b583b1d5.mp4?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out for yourself. No one else will do it for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beer Machine</i> tells the story of a child and his abusive father. Jump into the child’s mind and see how it came to be this way, and do what you can to help your father. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/bb692889591fea8404b41d69a423d0bc.poster.avif?t=1760553896\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/bb692889591fea8404b41d69a423d0bc.webm?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/bb692889591fea8404b41d69a423d0bc.mp4?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beer Machine</i> is a story-driven walking sim with mature and horror elements. You will be searching for objects and completing small activities as you play through the narrative.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your father needs a beer, and it's your job to get it.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re just a kid, but you have work to do.  Search across your house, neighborhood, and mind to find what your father needs, and bring it back to him. Be quick though, it isn't safe for children to be alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/ae13f482febf3d4fd0139d87b583b1d5.poster.avif?t=1760553896\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/ae13f482febf3d4fd0139d87b583b1d5.webm?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/ae13f482febf3d4fd0139d87b583b1d5.mp4?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out for yourself. No one else will do it for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beer Machine</i> tells the story of a child and his abusive father. Jump into the child’s mind and see how it came to be this way, and do what you can to help your father. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/bb692889591fea8404b41d69a423d0bc.poster.avif?t=1760553896\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/bb692889591fea8404b41d69a423d0bc.webm?t=1760553896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016300/extras/bb692889591fea8404b41d69a423d0bc.mp4?t=17605